@startuml Difftastic

rectangle Difftastic{
 (compare directories) as (UC1)
 (compare files) as (UC2)
 (integration into git) as (UC3)
 (analyze merge conflict) as (UC4)
 
}

Actor User as Man1
Actor File_System as Man2
Actor Git as Man3

Man3 -up-> UC1
Man2 -up-> UC2
Man3 -up-> UC3
Man3 -up-> UC4

left to right direction 

Man1 --> UC1
Man1 --> UC2
Man1 --> UC3
Man1 --> UC4

UC1 .> UC2 : include 
UC3 .> UC2 : include 
UC4 .> UC2 : include 

@enduml
